142722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a job about following rules. You must notice details, manage resources, weigh risks, and survive between doubt, fear, and responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect. Judge. Approve. Reject. Then face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect identities by checking documents, names, ID numbers, personal records, and abnormal clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the checkpoint computer to search records and compare information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question NPCs, inspect luggage, and look for suspicious behavior or forbidden items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make approval or rejection decisions by stamping documents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a day-and-night loop: inspect people by day, explore and survive by night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through dangerous environments, gather resources, and uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face consequences driven by your choices and mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live under constant pressure, where rules and records cannot always be trusted.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A first-person pixel-style inspection and stealth simulation game. Check visitor identities, search computer records, approve or reject NPCs, assign rooms, and sneak through the building at night to find evidence and uncover who can be trusted.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788950/2e7cbebb7d24ad0a9e7045570061871fbda6f8c7/header.jpg?t=1781142722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788950/d0e346903c7b7bab5c49bdf43644c5653108c799/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781142722", "capsule